# C14 (spec 1.6). Sign in with auth.http. The HTTP client keeps access cookies.
# Self needs users@delete; admin DELETE and the admin status branch also need users@delete_any.
# Idempotency-Key: 32 lowercase hex characters you choose (e.g. `openssl rand -hex 16`); it becomes the jobId.
@userId = <your-user-id>
@targetUserId = <another-user-id>
@challengeId = <challengeId-from-202>
@jobId = <32-lowercase-hex>

### Start self deletion: 202 with challengeId; the OTP is in Mailpit (localhost:8025)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-challenge

### A second one within 60 s: 429 resend_cooldown with retryAfterSeconds
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-challenge

### Resend after 60 s: 202, a new code; at most five deletion emails per hour
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-challenge/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId": "{{challengeId}}"}

### Someone else's id: 403 before any lookup
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/deletion-challenge

### Confirm: 202 {jobId, status: queued, statusUrl}, expired access/refresh cookies, account deleting
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}

{"challengeId": "{{challengeId}}", "code": "123456"}

### The same key again (a lost 202): 202 with the same job, no session needed
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}

{"challengeId": "{{challengeId}}", "code": "000000"}

### Status by receipt (self branch; the cookie is not read): 200 queued → running → succeeded
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deletion-status
Deletion-Receipt: {{jobId}}

### An unknown or mismatched receipt: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/deletion-status
Deletion-Receipt: {{jobId}}

### Admin: own id is 403 self_confirmation_required
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000000000000000000000000001

### Admin deletes someone else: 202; repeating (any key) returns the same job; a failed job is requeued
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000000000000000000000000002

### Admin status branch (no receipt header): 200, or 404 without a job
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/deletion-status
